.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIinfer(\fBx\fR as <generic> Matrix, 
\fBopts\fR as <generic> AracneOptions = \fB<NULL>\fR);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Run the inference with a pre-built [AracneOptions](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Model.Network.Regulons.ARACNE.AracneOptions) object.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBx\fB \fR\- the gene expression matrix, rows are the genes and columns are the samples. 
