the fitted [ARACNETools.aracneNetwork()](cref:M:TRNtoolkit.ARACNETools.aracneNetwork(SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.HTS.DataFrame.Matrix,System.Object,System.String,System.String,System.Double,System.Double,System.Int32,System.String,System.Double,System.String,System.Int32,System.Int32,System.Int32,System.Double,System.Boolean,System.Boolean,System.Boolean,System.Object,System.Double,System.Double,System.String,System.Double,System.Boolean,System.Int32,System.Int32,System.Boolean,SMRUCC.Rsharp.Runtime.Environment)) object
.PP
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
